==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{cal|ru|fr|inclure}} or {{cal|ru|de|einschließen|notext=1}}, ultimately a {{cal|ru|la|inclūdō|nocap=1}}. {{surf|ru|в-|-ключи́ть}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|включи́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-включить.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-включить.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|включи́ть|pf|impf=включа́ть}}

# {{lb|ru|transitive}} to [[switch on]], to [[power up]], to [[enable]] {{gloss|to put a mechanism, device or system into operation}}
#: {{syn|ru|активи́ровать}}
#: {{ant|ru|вы́ключить}}
#* {{quote-book|ru|year=2004|author=w:ru:Виктор Пелевин<t:{{w|Victor Pelevin}}>|title=w:ru:Священная книга оборотня|chapter=|location=Москва|publisher=w:ru:Эксмо|newversion=English translation from|translator2=w:Andrew Bromfield|title2=w:The Sacred Book of the Werewolf|location2=London|publisher2=w:[[Faber & Faber|Faber and Faber]]|year2=2008|page2=|pageurl2=|text=Войдя́ в ва́нную, я '''включи́ла''' душ и ста́ла гото́виться к рабо́те.|t=I went into the bathroom, '''turned on''' the shower and started getting ready for work.}}
# {{lb|ru|transitive}} to [[include]] {{gloss|to bring into as a part or member}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4b+p|включи́ть|or|4c|включи́ть|ppp=включённый|tail=*|notes=* Far more common but non-standard and sometimes proscribed.}}

